OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FTonight,
OL,6,Fthere will be clear spells but some
OL,7,Fshowers will continue to feed into the
OL,8,Fregion, mainly in the northwest, and
OL,9,Fsome of these may be heavy. It will
OL,10,Fremain breezy, and will feel cooler
OL,11,Fthan last night for some.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FA breezy, cool feeling day
OL,14,Fwith sunshine and showers. The showers
OL,15,Fmost frequent across the northwest and
OL,16,Fsome of these will be heavy. Showers
OL,17,Fand winds easing later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
